        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**  Please email to register interest to view this property  **\r\nAvailable 3rd October 2026. Three bedroom property available to let. Accommodation includes entrance hallway, kitchen/dining room, utility room, sitting room with  fireplace and an additional living room. Upstairs are three bedrooms and family bathroom. Front and rear gardens, off street parking, oil fired central heating. The property is in very good condition and is conveniently located in Kilcullen town. It is close to shops, schools, restaurants and all the amenities Kilcullen has to offer.\r\nOnly a short drive to the M9 Motorway intersection at Kilcullen, with easy access to the Dublin city. There is a bus service in Kilcullen also.\r\n\r\nViewing is strictly by appointment. All Interested parties please respond by email only.\r\nDeposit required\r\nFirst Month's rent required\r\nWritten references required"
